1
00:00:00,018 --> 00:00:04,268
(Howard:)All right, this is an exact duplicate
of the Wolowitz Zero-Gravity...

2
00:00:04,439 --> 00:00:07,569
(Howard:)...Human Waste Disposal System
as deployed on the Space Station.

3
00:00:07,734 --> 00:00:12,034
(Raj:)Don't you mean the Wolowitz Zero-Gravity
Human Waste Distribution System?

4
00:00:13,907 --> 00:00:16,157
Good one, yeah.

5
00:00:17,452 --> 00:00:18,532
[FAKES LAUGH]

6
00:00:18,703 --> 00:00:20,373
(Howard:)It's hilarious. Now.

7
00:00:20,747 --> 00:00:25,247
(Howard:)Here's an approximation of the spare parts
available on the space station.

8
00:00:25,418 --> 00:00:28,418
(Howard:)We gotta find a way, using nothing but this,
to reinforce this.

9
00:00:28,588 --> 00:00:30,508
So the waste material avoids the turbine.

10
00:00:30,673 --> 00:00:33,263
(Raj:)You mean, so it doesn't hit the fan?

11
00:00:37,597 --> 00:00:42,147
You know, I have to say I thought the toilet
humor would get less funny with repetition.

12
00:00:42,310 --> 00:00:46,520
(Sheldon:)Apparently, there is no law of diminishing
comedic returns with space poop.

13
00:00:47,649 --> 00:00:49,189
[KNOCKING]

14
00:00:51,444 --> 00:00:52,944
(Stuart:)- Hey, Leonard.
- Hey, Stuart.

15
00:00:53,112 --> 00:00:54,572
- You busy?
- Uh...

16
00:00:54,739 --> 00:00:56,529
(Howard:)Classified, Leonard.

17
00:00:56,991 --> 00:01:00,021
(Leonard:)Yeah, it's a regular Manhattan Project.

